      <title>Etoilé</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>GNUstep + OpenGroupware + Etoile</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://etoileos.com/etoile/&#34;&gt;Etoile&lt;/a&gt; is a Desktop Environment for Unix based on the GNUstep frameworks.&#xA;It focuses on the notions of modularity and small components, collaboration, persistence and flexibility.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In this talk I will present an overview of the project: its goals, concepts, and its current state.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
